(                            ORANGE NUT CAKE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  1 cup butter) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  2 eggs) Tj T*
(  2 cups flour \(all purpose\)) Tj T*
(  1 cup buttermilk) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon soda) Tj T*
(  1 orange \(squeeze juice, remove pulp\)) Tj T*
(  1 cup raisins) Tj T*
(  1 cup pecans) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Cream butter and sugar, add eggs 1 at a time. Sift flour and salt) Tj T*
(together, add soda to buttermilk, add to creamed mixture alternately) Tj T*
(with flour and nuts, raisins, orange peeling which has been put through) Tj T*
(food chopper. Bake in 8-inch layer pans greased and floured in 350) Tj T*
(degrees F. oven, 25 to 30 minutes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                         ICING ORANGE NUT CAKE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  2 cups powdered sugar) Tj T*
(  2 tablespoons orange juice) Tj T*
(  1 tablespoon lemon juice) Tj T*
(  3 tablespoons butter) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Cream butter, add small amount sugar, add orange and lemon juices) Tj T*
(alternately with sugar until icing is well blended.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(              A PIE THAT IS DIFFERENT?DATE NUT PUDDIN?-PIE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  2 eggs) Tj T*
(  ½ cup white sugar) Tj T*
(  1 tablespoon evaporated milk) Tj T*
(  1 tablespoon melted margarine) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon vanilla) Tj T*
(  ½ cup white cornmeal) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon baking powder) Tj T*
(  ? teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  ¾ cup \(or 1 six-ounce package\) dates chopped) Tj T*
(  ½ cup coarsely chopped nuts) Tj T*
(  ½ cup nut halves) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Beat eggs, add sugar, brown sugar, milk, margarine, corn meal, salt,) Tj T*
(baking powder, dates, nuts and vanilla. Mix well. Pour into a 9-inch pie) Tj T*
(plate which has been generously greased with margarine and dusted with) Tj T*
(corn meal. Top with the nut halves. Bake at 350 degrees for 45 minutes.) Tj T*
(Cool on a cake rack. Garnish with a circle of whipped cream flavored) Tj T*
(with sherry or almond flavoring. Sprinkle lightly with finely chopped) Tj T*
