(                                FILLING) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  ¾ cup ground walnuts) Tj T*
(  1 cup sugar) Tj T*
(  7 egg whites beaten stiff) Tj T*
(  2 grated apples) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Mix nuts and sugar. Add them gradually to beaten egg whites. Then fold) Tj T*
(in apples. Roll out two-thirds of the dough and line sides and bottom of) Tj T*
(an ungreased baking pan. Add filling. Roll out remaining dough and) Tj T*
(lattice over top. Bake in 250 degree oven 45 minutes to one hour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                            APPLE DUMPLINGS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  2 cups flour) Tj T*
(  2 teaspoons baking powder) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon sugar) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  4 level tablespoons lard or other shortening) Tj T*
(  enough milk to make soft dough) Tj T*
(  2 cups sweetened \(dried\) apples) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sift dry ingredients together, spread with sweetened apples. Then roll) Tj T*
(up like cinnamon rolls and cut about an inch wide. Set rolled slices in) Tj T*
(pan containing the following ingredients:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  3 cups water) Tj T*
(  3 cups sugar) Tj T*
(  2 tablespoons butter) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon cinnamon) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon nutmeg) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Bake in moderate oven until brown.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                           BOILED BROWN CAKE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  1 cup brown sugar) Tj T*
(  1 cup water) Tj T*
(  2 cups seeded \(sticky\) raisins) Tj T*
(  ½ cup lard) Tj T*
(  ¼ teaspoon nutmeg) Tj T*
(  ¼ teaspoon cinnamon) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon ground cloves) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Boil for three minutes. When cool add 2 cups sifted flour with ½) Tj T*
(teaspoon bicarbonate of soda dissolved in a little hot water. Bake in) Tj T*
(greased loafpan 325 degree oven for one a quarter hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                           IMP OF SATAN CAKE) Tj T*
