(  ¼ pound margarine) Tj T*
(  ¾ cup sugar) Tj T*
(  1½ cups cake flour) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  2 teaspoons baking powder) Tj T*
(  ½ cup milk) Tj T*
(  2 teaspoons finely chopped lemon peel) Tj T*
(  4 egg whites, stiffly beaten) Tj T*
(  2 teaspoons vanilla) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Cream sugar and shortening. Beat until fluffy. Sift cake flour, baking) Tj T*
(powder and salt. Then add to creamed mixture, alternating with milk. Add) Tj T*
(lemon, then chocolate. Fold in egg whites, vanilla, bake in two greased) Tj T*
(8-inch pans for 35 minutes in a 350 degree oven.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                          BRAZIL NUT DATE CAKE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  3 cups Brazil nuts \(2 pounds unshelled, 1 pound shelled\)) Tj T*
(  1 pound pitted imported dates) Tj T*
(  1 cup \(one 8-ounce jar\) drained maraschino cherries) Tj T*
(  ¾ cup sifted all-purpose flour) Tj T*
(  ¾ cup sugar) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon baking powder) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  3 eggs) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon vanilla) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Put Brazil nuts, dates and cherries into large bowl. Sift flour, sugar,) Tj T*
(baking powder and salt over nuts and fruit; mix with hands until nuts) Tj T*
(and fruit are coated. Beat eggs until foamy, add vanilla, stir into) Tj T*
(nut-fruit mixture until well mixed. Turn into greased and waxed) Tj T*
(paper-lined pan 9¼ by 5½ by 2½ inches. Spread evenly in pan. Bake in) Tj T*
(slow oven \(300 degrees F.\) 1 hour and 45 minutes. Cake must be cooled) Tj T*
(before slicing. \(Excellent cake to store in plastic bag for a week or) Tj T*
(two or store in deep freeze.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Note: For easy shelling of Brazil nuts, cover with cold water; bring to) Tj T*
(a boil and boil for 3 minutes. Drain and cover with cold water; drain) Tj T*
(and crack.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                              COWBOY CAKE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  2 cups sugar) Tj T*
(  2 cups hot water) Tj T*
(  ? cups shortening) Tj T*
(  2 cups raisins) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon nutmeg) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon cloves) Tj T*
(  2 teaspoons cinnamon) Tj T*
