() Tj T*
(Grease 8-inch pan, 10-inch skillet, or 9-inch ring mold. Make topping) Tj T*
(and have it ready.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  ¾ cup warm water) Tj T*
(  1 package dry yeast) Tj T*
(  ¼ cup sugar) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  2¼ cups sifted flour) Tj T*
(  1 egg) Tj T*
(  ¼ cup soft shortening or butter) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Dissolve yeast in water, add sugar and salt, and about half the flour.) Tj T*
(Beat thoroughly 2 minutes. Add egg and shortening. Then beat in) Tj T*
(gradually the remaining flour until smooth. Drop by spoonsful over) Tj T*
(entire bottom of pan. Cover. Let rise in warm place \(85 degrees\) until) Tj T*
(double in bulk, 50 to 60 minutes. Heat oven to 375 degrees. Bake until) Tj T*
(brown, 30 to 35 minutes. Immediately turn out to avoid sticking. Serve) Tj T*
(warm or cold.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
