(Blend sugar, salt and milk together. Bring to boil over medium heat and) Tj T*
(cook, stirring constantly, until mixture changes color slightly and) Tj T*
(thickens enough to form a firm ball in cool water. Then, working) Tj T*
(quickly, blend in vanilla extract, dates, nuts and coconut, drop in) Tj T*
(heaping teaspoonfuls on waxed paper. If part of mixture should harden in) Tj T*
(pan before you can transfer it to waxed paper, add only a few drops of) Tj T*
(water and reheat, stirring until it all comes together again \(it will be) Tj T*
(very thick\). Makes 5 dozen nuggets.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                            CHOCOLATE TAFFY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  1 cup water) Tj T*
(  2 squares unsweetened grated chocolate) Tj T*
(  1 cup sugar) Tj T*
(  1 cup molasses) Tj T*
(  2 tablespoons butter) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon vanilla) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Cook water, chocolate, sugar, molasses and butter together until the) Tj T*
(syrup forms a soft ball \(260 to 270 degrees if thermometer is used\) when) Tj T*
(dropped into cold water. Add vanilla and pour into a buttered pan to) Tj T*
(cool and harden. When stiff mark off in squares with a knife, when cold) Tj T*
(and brittle break off on marked squares.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                             YUMMY SQUARES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
