(  1 cup sugar) Tj T*
(  2 eggs, well beaten) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon vanilla) Tj T*
(  1½ cup sifted cake flour) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  1 teaspoon baking powder) Tj T*
(  1 egg white) Tj T*
(  1 cup brown sugar, firmly packed) Tj T*
(  1 cup chopped nuts) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Work shortening until creamy. Then add the sugar, work until light. Add) Tj T*
(the two well beaten eggs and vanilla. Then add the flour, salt, baking) Tj T*
(powder sifted together. Mix well and spread in greased pan, 13 by 9 by 2) Tj T*
(inches. Beat the egg white until stiff. Then add brown sugar. Continue) Tj T*
(beating until stiff. Then fold in nuts. Spread over mixture in pan and) Tj T*
(bake at 375 degrees for 25 minutes. Cut in squares.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                           DAINTY TEA COOKIES) Tj T*
