(stuffing. In a skillet sauté onions, bell peppers, celery, bean sprouts,) Tj T*
(pimiento and mushrooms in two tablespoons butter or margarine until) Tj T*
(onions become transparent but not brown. Move ingredients to side of) Tj T*
(skillet and in center place the cooked white rice and make a volcano to) Tj T*
(the bottom of skillet. In volcano add one tablespoon butter or margarine) Tj T*
(and when melted place whole raw egg and when egg has set add 2) Tj T*
(tablespoons soy sauce, the paprika, and gently stir until all) Tj T*
(ingredients are well mixed and egg is done and distributed throughout.) Tj T*
(Add salt and pepper to taste. Stuff pork chops with mixture, place in a) Tj T*
(shallow baking pan and bake in moderate oven until chops are done and) Tj T*
(well browned. Remove chops from pan and pour off all grease. To the) Tj T*
(remaining brown drippings add 1 tablespoon flour dissolved in 1 cup) Tj T*
(chicken stock and 2 tablespoons soy sauce and stir until sauce thickens.) Tj T*
(On serving spoon sauce over chops. Serves 6.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                               TATER DOG) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Cut an Idaho potato about 5 inches long in half. With a spoon scrape out) Tj T*
(the center of both halves, enough to hold a wiener. Insert the wiener in) Tj T*
(the cavity, spread with margarine, a dash of salt and pepper and chili) Tj T*
(sauce. Butt the potato together, use 2 toothpicks to hold. Grease) Tj T*
(outside liberally with butter or margarine. Put into oven, bake until) Tj T*
(potato is well baked. With serving of cole slaw or similar salad, this) Tj T*
(will be a most appetizing meal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                           TIME-SAVER DINNER) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  1 pound hamburger meat) Tj T*
(  1 clove garlic, chopped fine) Tj T*
(  1 small onion, chopped fine) Tj T*
(  ½ small bell pepper, chopped fine) Tj T*
(  ½ teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(  ¼ teaspoon black pepper) Tj T*
(  1 can tomatoes) Tj T*
(  1 can tomato sauce) Tj T*
(  3 tablespoons tomato catsup) Tj T*
(  ¼ teaspoon hot sauce) Tj T*
(  ¼ teaspoon Worcestershire sauce) Tj T*
(  2 cups water) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Mix salt, pepper, onion, garlic and bell pepper. Drain tomatoes and mash) Tj T*
(them, saving juice. Add all this to meat and mix well. Take tomato juice) Tj T*
(and add tomato sauce, hot sauce, Worcestershire sauce together. Put this) Tj T*
ET
