(with water and pour over meat loaf. Put tomato catsup over top of meat) Tj T*
(loaf. Peel two medium size potatoes. Cut in quarters and put around meat) Tj T*
(loaf. Bake in 450 degrees oven for 1½ hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                            GARLIC SPARERIBS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  6 pounds spareribs) Tj T*
(  4 large cloves garlic) Tj T*
(  1 tablespoon salt) Tj T*
(  1 cup chicken stock or consomme) Tj T*
(  1 cup orange marmalade) Tj T*
(  ¼ cup vinegar) Tj T*
(  ¼ cup ketchup) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Figure at least 1 pound spareribs per person. Leave sides whole so they) Tj T*
(can be threaded on a spit later. Crush garlic with salt. Add chicken) Tj T*
(stock or consomme with marmalade, vinegar and ketchup. Marinate ribs at) Tj T*
(least 12 hours in garlic marinade, turning several times. Weave the) Tj T*
(whole strips on spit and cook slowly over low coals for 1 to 1½ hours or) Tj T*
(until shiny brown and fork tender. Baste with the marinade during the) Tj T*
(cooking. Or if preferred, bake ribs in slow oven \(300 degrees F.\) for 2) Tj T*
(hours. Baste often.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                             KIDS? DELIGHT) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Prepare one recipe for biscuit dough. Roll out thin, cut in three) Tj T*
(pieces. Spread one piece with apple jelly and peanut butter. Spread one) Tj T*
(piece with stewed apples and grated cheese. Spread one piece with fig) Tj T*
(preserves. Roll each piece into a slender roll. Slice into 1-inch) Tj T*
(thickness. Place on greased pan, bake 12 minutes in moderate oven.) Tj T*
